---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Container from '../components/layout/Container.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const updated = 'August 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms of use for Webcam Test — a free, browser-based camera and microphone testing tool."
>
  <Container class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="caption-mono uppercase text-mute">Terms</p>
      <h1 class="display-xl mt-3 text-ink">Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="body-lg mt-6 text-body">
        {SITE.name} is a free tool provided as-is. These terms describe what you can expect from
        it and what we ask of you in return. Using the site means you accept them.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display-md mt-12 text-ink">Using the service</h2>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        You may use this site for any lawful purpose, personal or commercial, at no cost and
        without creating an account. You agree not to attempt to disrupt the service, to probe or
        attack the infrastructure that hosts it, or to use it in a way that breaks the law where
        you live.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display-md mt-10 text-ink">No warranty</h2>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        The tools here are provided without warranty of any kind. The measurements they report —
        resolution, frame rate, aspect ratio, audio level — depend on your hardware, drivers,
        browser and operating system, all of which we do not control. They are intended as a
        practical guide, not as a certified instrument, and we do not guarantee that the site
        will be available, uninterrupted, or free of errors.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display-md mt-10 text-ink">Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss or damage arising
        from your use of this site, including any missed meeting, interview, stream or
        opportunity. Test your equipment with enough time to fix what you find.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display-md mt-10 text-ink">Your camera and microphone</h2>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        Access to your camera and microphone is granted by you, through your browser, and can be
        withdrawn by you at any time. All processing happens on your device, as described in our{' '}
        <a class="text-link hover:text-link-deep" href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>, which forms
        part of these terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display-md mt-10 text-ink">Intellectual property</h2>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        The design, text and code of this site belong to its operators. Any snapshot you capture
        is yours — it is created on your device from your own camera, and we claim no rights over
        it whatsoever.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display-md mt-10 text-ink">Changes</h2>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        These terms may be updated from time to time. The current version always lives on this
        page, with the revision date shown below.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display-md mt-10 text-ink">Contact</h2>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        Questions about these terms can be sent to{' '}
        <a class="text-link hover:text-link-deep" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="caption mt-12 text-mute">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
